  - parametric bootstrap
  - Monte Carlo test
  - convolutional neural network
abstract: >-
  Research compendium for DeepGOF-1, a goodness-of-fit test for logistic regression whose
  statistic is a convolutional network trained once offline and shipped frozen, and whose
  p-value is the rank of the observed score inside the analyst's own parametric bootstrap.
  Contains the deployable test in base R, the frozen weights, the exact training corpus and
  its generator, the thirteen-arm benchmark harness, every per-replicate p-value behind the
  paper, and the frozen pre-declared evaluation criteria.
